   <string>See </string><link linkend="87496: 06_Table: Table 2-50. Type E4NF Class Exception Conditions"><string>Table&#160;2&#8209;52, &#8220;Type E4NF Class Exception Conditions.&#8221;</string></link></para>
  </subsection>
 </instruction>
